ize='22' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>第四级 · 局部示例</text><path d='M562 261 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='272' width='1140' height='56' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='570.0' y='294.0' font-size='22' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>第五级 · 完整结果</text><text x='570.0' y='320.0' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>帮助学生最多</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #E8A33D', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>关键风险：答对次数增加，可能来自提示变多而非独立能力提高——需在新题中单独观察无提示表现。不能将突然撤去支持当作已经掌握，允许适度回退</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：待深化功能研究.md §2</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 97 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>